% Canonical modern reference for experimentally measured dopamine
% diffusion coefficient D and reuptake rate parameters in striatal
% tissue. Synthesizes FSCV and microdialysis evidence from the
% Cragg/Rice/Garris/Wightman labs. Wiencke et al. 2020 (already in
% refs as [[Wiencke2020]]) cites this paper for their parameter
% choices, making it the natural companion citation for the
% parameter table in our manuscript. Note: for D specifically, this
% should be co-cited with Nicholson & Phillips 1981 ([[Nicholson1981]])
% which provides the underlying free-diffusion measurement.
